Z||000002||Orlando||08-18-99||06:22 PM||||It could be the factory alarm system. I was reading through the Haynes manual trying to figure out where the horn relay was, and there is a picture of the horn relay/flasher relay connection block, and there was another module that was the factory alarm. I've had an 86 GT and I now have an 88 Formula. I see the socket for the alarm, but I do not have one. Check under the dash, on the passanger side, where the relays are connected to the A/C box. You may have the alarm. But then again, what do I know...
