Z||000004||ezsurf||08-26-99||12:25 AM||||Stetz,<br>I can't say for sure, but it sounds kinda like a fake auto alarm.  A lot of auto alarms have a flashing red led.  Years ago, some company used to make a red led to simulate an alarm when the car really didn't have one.  This seems to fit the discription.  
